# v01.0: Export the task list as CSV

Issue: #58

A support request asked for a downloadable copy of the task list, filed before
the list endpoint carried pagination.

## Outcomes

- [ ] Outcome: a CSV download carries every task's title and status
- [ ] Outcome: the file name carries today's date

## Findings

- Filed against the list endpoint's original, unbounded response, before
  pagination existed.
- v02.0 already scopes a bounded JSON response the same client renders as a
  table, so a standalone CSV download duplicates work already planned there.
  Declining this task as redundant rather than building a second path to the
  same data.

> Test strategy: manual, download the file and open it in a spreadsheet.
